C: the catch is he picks his head back up | the catch is the part where he doesn't die
D: he's neutral for a reason. some things in albion are older than our quarrels | i rode past him once. he looked through me like i was weather
?B: i heard about a raid that tried him. the story always stops halfway | three groups went at him once, so they say. nobody tells the end
